  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>The tangents at the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math> on the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, intersect at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>.&nbsp;</p><p>So, equation of tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>)</mo></math> on circle will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>152</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And equation of tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math> on circle is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>13</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>104</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;in equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, the&nbsp;point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now equation of tangent&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
